items.fromString:
From the EJB client, connect to server and list namespace. Note that the error reported will only be thrown when listing a leaf node from the JNDI tree. 

Properties p = new Properties(); Properties p = new Properties(); p.put(Context.PROVIDER_URL, "remote+http://yourdomain:port");    p.put(Context.INITIAL_CONTEXT_FACTORY,"org.wildfly.naming.client.WildFlyInitialContextFactory"); 

Context c = NamingManager.getInitialContext(p); NamingEnumeration<NameClassPair> ncp = c.list("jms/RemoteConnectionFactory");

